      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "f(int index,int currentSum) :\n\n    if(index>=n) :\n\n        return currentSum==target ? 1 : 0\n    \n    // take +\n\n    int a1 = f(index,currentSum+arr[index])\n\n    // take -\n    int a2  =f(index,currentSum-arr[index])\n\n\n    return a1+a2",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "f(int index,int currentSum) :\n\n    if(index>=n) :\n\n        return currentSum==target ? 1 : 0\n    \n    // take +\n\n    int a1 = f(index,currentSum+arr[index])\n\n    // take -\n    int a2  =f(index,currentSum-arr[index])\n\n\n    return a1+a2",
